h?"},{"p":6,"b":6,"s":"Arthur \"Monk\" Hazel","x":"Yeah. Here's the."},{"p":6,"b":7,"s":"Richard B. Allen","x":"Boswell."},{"p":6,"b":8,"s":"Arthur \"Monk\" Hazel","x":"That's the first picture. That's when they were really young. That's the first picture I ever got from the kids. Here's Happy Shillings band."},{"p":6,"b":9,"s":"Richard B. Allen","x":"Oh that's made in Chicago."},{"p":6,"b":10,"s":"Arthur \"Monk\" Hazel","x":"Yeah that's when they first went on the road. That's the halfway house."},{"p":6,"b":11,"s":"Richard B. Allen","x":"What's the drummer in that picture then?"},{"p":6,"b":12,"s":"Arthur \"Monk\" Hazel","x":"Leo Addy."},{"p":6,"b":13,"s":"SPEAKER_03","x":"That's the band that recorded then."},{"p":6,"b":14,"s":"Arthur \"Monk\" Hazel","x":"That's one of the bands that recorded. I made a bunch of records with them. Leo came in after me. I think Snotsy only made one record. I made, I think I made the most records with them. This with Austin."},{"p":6,"b":15,"s":"SPEAKER_03","x":"Oh that's here with Gene."},{"p":6,"b":16,"s":"Arthur \"Monk\" Hazel","x":"Yeah. Peter Fountain before he got his rug."},{"p":6,"b":17,"s":"SPEAKER_03","x":"Uh huh. Well now back to the uh."},{"p":6,"b":18,"s":"Arthur \"Monk\" Hazel","x":"It's Wiggs. It's Witchcombe band."},{"p":6,"b":19,"s":"SPEAKER_03","x":"Oh yeah. At the radio station."},{"p":6,"b":20,"s":"Arthur \"Monk\" Hazel","x":"There's when Ramon was playing with Shockey. I don't see it here Bill. That's alright."},{"p":6,"b":21,"s":"Richard B. Allen","x":"I've seen some pictures."}]}